{"id": "34387", "title": "永恒的琥珀", "author": "岑凯伦", "category": "文学名著", "count": 16, "available": 0, "cover": "", "status": "已完成", "source": "files/article/info/34/34387.htm", "intro": "琥珀自幼父母双亡，寄居在叔父冷柏年家。冷柏年待她如已出，但冷柏年妻子及其娘家人把琥珀视为窆仇。乘冷柏年一次出国之机，他们联合起来陷害琥珀，琥珀被迫离开冷家，流浪在外，初恋情人也因误会离她而去。琥珀咬牙挺了过去，靠着她的善良、聪慧和百折不挠的意志，终于在商界出人头地，成了商界女强人，并最终赢得了真正的爱情。", "base": "files/article/html/34/34387", "chapters": [{"title": "第一节", "file": "2184519.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第二节", "file": "2184520.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第三节", "file": "2184521.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第四节", "file": "2184522.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第五节", "file": "2184523.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第六节", "file": "2184524.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第七节", "file": "2184525.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第八节", "file": "2184526.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第九节", "file": "2184527.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第十节", "file": "2184528.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第十一节", "file": "2184529.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第十二节", "file": "2184530.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第十三节", "file": "2184531.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第十四节", "file": "2184532.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第十五节", "file": "2184533.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第十六节", "file": "2184534.html", "available": false}]}